      <https://w3id.org/iadopt/ont/Variable>;
    dct:description "A measure of the average kinetic energy of a system of particles. Temperature may be quantified, in the context of thermodynamics, as the potential of one system to transfer thermal energy to another system until both systems reach a state of thermal equilibrium";
